 * 
 * Immutable class representing a chapter containing multiple sections.
 * Chapters are organizational units within a project that group related sections.
 * 
 * @example
 * ```typescript
 * // Create new chapter
 * const chapter = new Chapter({ 
 *   title: 'Introduction',
 *   sections: []
